dashboard.definition:
{
  "title": "Circle Markers",
  "description": "Maps+ example: circle markers.",
  "dataSources": {
    "ds_map": {
      "type": "ds.search",
      "name": "Map rows",
      "options": {
        "query": "| inputlookup chicago-crime.csv\n| eval description = \"<b>\".description.\"</b>\", \ntooltip=description, \nclusterGroup=\"default\",\nmarkerType=\"circle\", \nlayerGroup=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"simple\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"domestic\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"five_hundred\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"property\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"retail\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"vehicle\", 1=1, \"default\"), \ncircleColor=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"#42f498\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"rgb(95, 66, 244)\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"#41f4ee\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"rgb(175, 244, 65)\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"#f46741\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"cadetblue\", 1=1, \"#f44164\"),      \ncircleFillColor=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"#f442c8\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"#be41f4\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"#d1ef62\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"rgb(99, 14, 76)\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"#370e63\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"#72066b\", 1=1, \"#f2074d\"), \ncircleOpacity=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"0.4\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"0.4\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"0.7\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"0.8\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"0.3\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"0.5\", 1=1, \"0.6\"),\ncircleFillOpacity=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"1.0\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"0.3\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"0.5\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"0.6\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"0.7\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"0.3\", 1=1, \"0.4\"),\ncircleRadius=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"15\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"10\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"12\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"7\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"5\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"6\", 1=1, \"4\"),\ncircleStroke=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"true\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"true\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"false\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"true\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"false\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"cadetblue\", 1=1, \"true\"),\ncircleWeight=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"20\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"10\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"12\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"8\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"15\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"13\", 1=1, \"8\"),\nlayerPriority=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"1\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"10\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"12\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"8\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"15\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"13\", 1=1, \"8\")\n| table latitude, longitude, description, tooltip, markerType, clusterGroup, layerGroup, circleColor, circleFillColor, circleOpacity, circleFillOpacity, circleRadius, circleStroke, circleWeight, layerPriority",
        "queryParameters": {
          "earliest": "-24h@h",
          "latest": "now"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "visualizations": {
    "viz_intro": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "Use circle markers when you have a lot of points to plot and you need performance. Circle markers are rendered using canvas instead of SVG which gives a huge performance boost. Use the following fields to change the look and behavior of circle markers.\n\n`circleColor` `circleFillColor` `circleOpacity` `circleFillOpacity` `circleRadius` `circleStroke` `circleWeight`\n\n**Warning:** When using the `canvas` renderer in conjunction with `layerPriority`, mouse events are affected for all layers below the highest priority layer. This is [a bug in Leaflet](https://github.com/Leaflet/Leaflet/issues/4135). If you don't need to use `tooltip`, `description` or drilldown and want the performance boost canvas provides, this shouldn't be an issue."
      }
    },
    "viz_map": {
      "type": "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus",
      "title": "circleColor, circleFillColor, circleOpacity, circleFillOpacity, circleRadius, circleStroke, circleWeight, layerGroup, layerPriority",
      "dataSources": {
        "primary": "ds_map"
      },
      "options": {
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.allPopups": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.animate": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.autoFitAndZoom": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.autoFitAndZoomDelay": "500",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.bingMaps": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.bingMapsLabelLanguage": "en-US",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.bingMapsTileLayer": "CanvasLight",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.cluster": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.contextMenu": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.criticalThreshold": "80",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.defaultHeight": "600",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.disableClusteringAtZoom": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.drilldown": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.drilldownAction": "dblclick",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.fullScreen": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.googlePlacesPosition": "topleft",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.googlePlacesSearch": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.googlePlacesZoomLevel": "12",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapBlur": "15",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapColorGradient": "{\"0.4\":\"blue\",\"0.6\":\"cyan\",\"0.7\":\"lime\",\"0.8\":\"yellow\",\"1\":\"red\"}",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapEnable": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapMaxPointIntensity": "1.0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapMinOpacity": "1.0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapOnly": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.heatmapRadius": "25",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.i18nLanguage": "en",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.layerControl": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.layerControlCollapsed": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.mapCenterLat": "39.50",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.mapCenterLon": "-98.35",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.mapCenterZoom": "6",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.mapTile": "https://{s}.basemaps.cartocdn.com/light_all/{z}/{x}/{y}.png",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.maxClusterRadius": "80",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.maxSpiderfySize": "100",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.maxZoom": "19",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureActiveColor": "#00ff00",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureCompletedColor": "#0066ff",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureIconPosition": "topright",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureLocalization": "en",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measurePrimaryAreaUnit": "acres",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measurePrimaryLengthUnit": "feet",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureSecondaryAreaUnit": "sqmiles",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureSecondaryLengthUnit": "miles",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.measureTool": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.minZoom": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.multiplePopups": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.pathColorList": "#0003F0,#D43C29,darkgreen,0xe2d400,darkred,#23A378",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.pathSplitInterval": "60",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.pathSplits": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.permanentTooltip": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeOneBgColor": "#B5E28C",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeOneFgColor": "#6ECC39",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeThreeBgColor": "#FD9C73",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeThreeFgColor": "#F18017",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeTwoBgColor": "#F1D357",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.rangeTwoFgColor": "#F0C20C",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.refreshInterval": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.renderer": "svg",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.scrollWheelZoom": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.showPathLines": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.showProgress": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.singleMarkerMode": "0",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.spiderfyDistanceMultiplier": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.stickyTooltip": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.warningThreshold": "55",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.useOpenFreeMap": "1",
        "leaflet_maps_app.maps-plus.maplibreStylePreset": "positron"
      }
    },
    "viz_teach": {
      "type": "splunk.markdown",
      "options": {
        "markdown": "## What this shows\nCrime rows drawn as **circle markers**: lightweight vector circles with per-row stroke, fill, opacity, radius and layer. They do not depend on icon fonts.\n\n## The SPL\n```spl\n| inputlookup chicago-crime.csv\n| eval description = \"<b>\".description.\"</b>\", \ntooltip=description, \nclusterGroup=\"default\",\nmarkerType=\"circle\", \nlayerGroup=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"simple\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"domestic\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"five_hundred\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"property\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"retail\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"vehicle\", 1=1, \"default\"), \ncircleColor=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"#42f498\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"rgb(95, 66, 244)\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"#41f4ee\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"rgb(175, 244, 65)\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"#f46741\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"cadetblue\", 1=1, \"#f44164\"),      \ncircleFillColor=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"#f442c8\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"#be41f4\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"#d1ef62\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"rgb(99, 14, 76)\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"#370e63\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"#72066b\", 1=1, \"#f2074d\"), \ncircleOpacity=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"0.4\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"0.4\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"0.7\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"0.8\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"0.3\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"0.5\", 1=1, \"0.6\"),\ncircleFillOpacity=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"1.0\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"0.3\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"0.5\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"0.6\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"0.7\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"0.3\", 1=1, \"0.4\"),\ncircleRadius=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"15\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"10\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"12\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"7\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"5\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"6\", 1=1, \"4\"),\ncircleStroke=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"true\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"true\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"false\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"true\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"false\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"cadetblue\", 1=1, \"true\"),\ncircleWeight=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"20\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"10\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"12\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"8\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"15\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"13\", 1=1, \"8\"),\nlayerPriority=case(like(description, \"%SIMPLE%\"), \"1\", like(description, \"%DOMESTIC BATTERY%\"), \"10\", like(description, \"%500 AND UNDER%\"), \"12\", like(description, \"%TO PROPERTY%\"), \"8\", like(description, \"%RETAIL THEFT%\"), \"15\", like(description, \"%TO VEHICLE%\"), \"13\", 1=1, \"8\")\n| table latitude, longitude, description, tooltip, markerType, clusterGroup, layerGroup, circleColor, circleFillColor, circleOpacity, circleFillOpacity, circleRadius, circleStroke, circleWeight, layerPriority\n```\n\n## How it works\n1. `inputlookup` loads the rows.\n2. One `eval` first wraps `description` in `<b>`, so the later `like(description, ...)` tests still match (the crime text is still inside). It also sets `tooltip`, `clusterGroup` and `markerType=\"circle\"`.\n3. `layerGroup` gives each crime type its own layer (toggle them in the layer control); `layerPriority` orders them.\n4. The `circle*` fields are looked up per crime type with `case`. Values are quoted strings: Maps+ reads rows as strings.\n5. `table` lists the fields Maps+ reads.\n\n## Field formats and rules\n| Field | Expected format | Rule / gotcha |\n|---|---|---|\n| `latitude` | decimal degrees, numeric (e.g. `41.88`) | Exact lowercase name, required on marker rows. Only the first row is checked; if it has no `latitude`+`longitude` the panel shows an error. |\n| `longitude` | decimal degrees, numeric (e.g. `-87.72`) | Exact lowercase name. Longitude is negative west of Greenwich. Rows at 0,0 usually mean missing coordinates. |\n| `markerType` | `circle` | Required to get circles instead of pins. |\n| `circleColor / circleFillColor` | any CSS colour | Stroke / fill. Defaults: `#3388ff`, and fill defaults to the stroke colour. |\n| `circleOpacity / circleFillOpacity` | `0` to `1` | Defaults `1` and `0.2`. |\n| `circleRadius / circleWeight` | integer pixels | Defaults `10` and `3`. |\n| `circleStroke` | `\"true\"` or `\"false\"` | Only the exact string `\"true\"` is true. This query sets `\"cadetblue\"` for TO VEHICLE rows, which counts as false, so those circles have no outline. |\n| `layerGroup` | layer name | One layer-control entry per value. |\n| `layerPriority` | integer | Pane order of the layer. |\n| `tooltip / description` | HTML string | Hover / popup. Raw HTML. |\n| `clusterGroup` | any name except `one`, `two`, `three` | Option `cluster` is `0` here, so no clustering happens. |\n\n## Try it\n- Change `circleRadius` for RETAIL THEFT from `\"5\"` to `\"14\"`.\n- Change `circleStroke` for TO VEHICLE from `\"cadetblue\"` to `\"true\"` to give those circles an outline.\n\nStudio note: the original `mapTile` (a CARTO URL) is kept, but this Studio version turns on keyless OpenFreeMap (`useOpenFreeMap` = 1), because CARTO tiles show an \"API KEY REQUIRED\" watermark without a key.\n\n**Basemap:** this example uses keyless OpenFreeMap vector tiles (`useOpenFreeMap` = 1). CARTO basemaps need a free API key: see **Help > Basemaps & API keys** for how to get one and where to put it (**Map Tile Override**)."
      }
    }
  },
  "layout": {
    "tabs": {
      "items": [
        {
          "label": "New tab",
          "layoutId": "layout_1"
        }
      ]
    },
    "layoutDefinitions": {
      "layout_1": {
        "type": "absolute",
        "options": {
          "width": 1440,
          "height": 990,
          "display": "auto"
        },
        "structure": [
          {
            "item": "viz_intro",
            "type": "block",
            "position": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 0,
              "w": 1440,
              "h": 230
            }
          },
          {
            "item": "viz_map",
            "type": "block",
            "position": {
              "x": 0,
              "y": 230,
              "w": 880,
              "h": 760
            }
          },
          {
            "item": "viz_teach",
            "type": "block",
            "position": {
              "x": 880,
              "y": 230,
              "w": 560,
              "h": 760
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    }
  }
}
